  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The fury of your allies is contagious.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sympathetic Rage<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can continue raging as long as you are within 5 feet per mythic tier of an ally who is raging. If more than one ally is raging, you can maintain your rage as long as you end your turn within this distance of a raging ally; you need not remain near the ally who was raging when you first used this feat. If you move away from your raging ally or if your ally dies or its rage ends, you can expend one use of mythic power to continue your sympathetic rage for a number of rounds equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). If you come within range of a raging ally before this duration expires, you can continue raging.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc111\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
